OL,3,GNEWSATwo murder arrests after man
OL,4,Aattacked in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a 52-year-old man was
OL,8,Fattacked in the street.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said he
OL,11,Fwas found unconscious in South Parade,
OL,12,FRochdale, at 01:30 BST.
OL,14,FThe man later died in hospital. Police
OL,15,Fsaid his family were being supported by
OL,16,Fspecialist officers.
OL,18,FDet Ch Insp Claire Brennan, whose force
OL,19,Fhas appealed for any CCTV, doorbell or
OL,20,Fdashcam footage, described what had
OL,21,Fhappened as a "heart-breaking
OL,22,Fincident".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
